      "sender": "SYSTEM",
      "recipient": "USER",
      "content": "{{USER_INSTRUCTION}}ROUND 1 [provide: image_1, image_2, image_3]\nQuery: Create a new Todoist project called 'Facility Setup'. Then, look at these three photos. I need you to add a task to landscape the architectural area shown in the first image, a task to inspect the industrial equipment in the second image, and a task to purchase the household appliance in the third image.\nInstructions: Ask the assistant to create a new Todoist project called 'Facility Setup' and add three specific tasks based on the provided images. If the assistant asks for more details or struggles to identify the items, direct it to carefully examine the main subject of each photo to determine what needs landscaping, inspecting, and purchasing. Do not name the items yourself. Once the assistant confirms the project and the three tasks have been created, move on to the next round.\n\nROUND 2\nQuery: Now, read my note about 'Pending Purchases' and aggregate its listed items by adding them as additional tasks to the 'Facility Setup' project, consolidating all our action items in one place.\nInstructions: Ask the assistant to read your note about pending purchases and add the items listed in it as new tasks to the 'Facility Setup' project. Because you have multiple notes with similar names on your device, the assistant should ask you to clarify which note you mean. When it asks for clarification, tell it to use the one for the facility. Once the assistant confirms that the additional tasks from the correct note have been added to the project, you can end the conversation.\n\nYou have 3 images available to share with the agent using the send_message_with_image tool.\nIMPORTANT: Image IDs are ZERO-INDEXED integers (0, 1, 2, ...). Do NOT add 1 to the IDs.\nAvailable image IDs: [0, 1, 2]\nImage mapping:\n  image_1.jpg -> image ID 0\n  image_2.jpg -> image ID 1\n  image_3.jpg -> image ID 2"
    },
